    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Count opposing parastichy families in many georeferenced cones per conifer species and estimate within-species frequency distributions, explicitly checking the stated 5/3 spruce and 8/5 larch modes. Tight species-specific modes support the claim; broad variation or different dominant counts refutes it.";
